e in jail (not saying I approve, but think about it)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I agree with you . Just make sure you rip out the dash cam.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7122403356226130660/comments/default/1803204613725520034'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7122403356226130660/comments/default/1803204613725520034'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/the-protected-predator-class.html?showComment=1369873000569#c1803204613725520034' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/the-protected-predator-class.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7122403356226130660' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7122403356226130660' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-809676503"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 29, 2013 at 6:16 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6589475840728093312</id><published>2013-05-29T17:34:47.203-06:00</published><updated>2013-05-29T17:34:47.203-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Creeps and perverts are always attracted to positi...</title><content type='html'>Creeps and perverts are always attracted to positions of authority. There, they can indulge their twisted proclivities without fear of being held accountable. The above  picture of the BCSO boys playing dress-up kind of proves my point. And Tamsen Reid still believing in &amp;quot;law enforcement&amp;quot;, please woman, pull your head out of your ass!    </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http